# Nutrition Tracker

Lokales, dateibasiertes Nutrition-Tracking mit AI-gestützter Erfassung aus Bildern und Freitext.

## Status

MVP-Backend implementiert: deterministic Python CLI, JSON-first, file-based source of truth.

## Setup

```bash
python3 -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate
pip install -e '.[dev]'
```

## CLI

Console script after install:

```bash
nutrition --help
```

Direct module form during development:

```bash
PYTHONPATH=src python -m nutrition_tracker.cli --help
```

## Commands

```bash
nutrition init --path . --json
nutrition goals derive --path . --json
nutrition meal add --path . --file meal.json --json
nutrition meal correct --path . --file correction.json --json
nutrition meal list 2026-05-31 --path . --json
nutrition day show 2026-05-31 --path . --json
nutrition week show 2026-W22 --path . --json
nutrition doctor --path . --json
```

## Storage

Source of truth:

```text
data/settings.json
data/meals/YYYY/YYYY-MM-DD.jsonl
data/corrections/YYYY/YYYY-MM-DD.jsonl
```

Derived, rebuildable read models:

```text
data/daily/YYYY/YYYY-MM-DD.summary.json
data/weekly/YYYY/YYYY-Www.summary.json
```

Schemas live in `schemas/` and are copied by `nutrition init`.

## Sample meal payload

```json
{
  "timestamp": "2026-05-31T12:34:56+02:00",
  "source": "manual",
  "foods": [
    {
      "label": "Hähnchenbrust",
      "amount": 180,
      "unit": "g",
      "estimated": false,
      "confidence": "high"
    }
  ],
  "nutrition": {
    "kcal": 620,
    "protein_g": 48,
    "fat_g": 14,
    "carbs_g": 71,
    "fiber_g": 4
  },
  "quality_signals": {
    "fruit_servings": 0,
    "vegetable_servings": 1,
    "highly_processed": false
  },
  "assumptions": ["Kein zusätzliches Öl sichtbar"],
  "notes": "Mittagessen"
}
```

## Sample correction payload

```json
{
  "timestamp": "2026-05-31T13:10:00+02:00",
  "meal_id": "meal_2026-05-31T12-34-56+02-00_001",
  "operation": "replace",
  "changes": {
    "nutrition": {
      "kcal": 670,
      "protein_g": 49,
      "fat_g": 14,
      "carbs_g": 82,
      "fiber_g": 4
    }
  },
  "reason": "User corrected rice amount"
}
```

## Verify

```bash
ruff check src tests
PYTHONPATH=src pytest -v
```

